    </w:r>
    <w:r>
      <w:rPr><w:sz w:val="22"/><w:color w:val="1E293B"/></w:rPr>
      <w:t xml:space="preserve">"In Listing History, every card displays zero blank fields and zero nulls. Our Boss Skill AI synthesizes the entire squad’s findings into a short executive comment preview right on the card for instant decision-making."</w:t>
    </w:r>
